{
  "$comment": "Command baseline from the nexus (missioncontrol blueprints/settings daf6110, MC-00024, revision 5: IntelliJ MCP per-tool rules, MC-00031), then ultra's own entries at the end of deny. Deny always wins over allow, including over settings.local.json. invoke_ide_action has no rule: the PreToolUse hook .claude/hooks/idea-action-gate.py decides (actions on .claude/hooks/idea-actions.allow run, others ask). Hooks load at session start: restart the session after changing this file.",
